OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Frather breezy this evening but staying
OL,7,Fdry. Cloud building from the southwest
OL,8,Fovernight, this thick enough to give
OL,9,Fthe odd spot of light rain, with
OL,10,Foccasional clear spells possible. A
OL,11,Fvery mild night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,14,Fwindy, although the odd brighter break
OL,15,Fis possible. Rain edging into the far
OL,16,Fnorthwest later. Very mild and feeling
OL,17,Funseasonably warm in any brightness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
